A pandas UDF scores one numeric column with a model that takes 30 seconds to load. The model must load once per iterator, not once per Arrow batch:
    @pandas_udf("double")
    def score(batches: ________) -> Iterator[pd.Series]:
        model = load_model()
        for s in batches:
            yield pd.Series(model.predict(s))
Which type hint fills the blank?

